# Build 97d: the one-shot case $D at a level load. loc_8022 is `rts`, so
# the event word stays $D00 across the load: the hold goes on -- the
# leader stands still, and A and the C menu stay shut. In play only B1's
# Esper sets $D00 (esper_b1_hold), and nothing can reload the level while
# it lasts; here the probe puts $D in the word before a warp onto Noah F1.
# Before 97d the port's load reported "one-shot event $0D is not ported",
# dropped it, and the party walked.
start level $64 33 10
party 4 50
wait idle
oneshot $D
warp $64 33 10
wait level $64
wait ticks 30
expect no-stderr not ported
press up                     # held: still on 33,10
wait ticks 30
expect level $64 33 10
press c                      # the C menu shut
wait ticks 30
expect menu none
shot 01_held
